{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36196","headline":"叙雪寄喻凫 · 方干","name":"叙雪寄喻凫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"密片无声急复迟，纷纷犹胜落花时。\n从容不觉藏苔迳，宛转偏宜傍柳丝。\n透室虚明非月照，满空回散是风吹。\n高人坐卧才方逸，援笔应成六出词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}